188
00:12:43,780 --> 00:12:44,820
And this is Joe.

189
00:12:45,080 --> 00:12:47,140
I'd shake hands, if you had me.

190
00:12:47,540 --> 00:12:49,422
Izzy here's our computer expert.

191
00:12:49,540 --> 00:12:51,187
Do you have Internet access?

192
00:12:51,300 --> 00:12:56,080
And last but not least, this little
guy is, uh... TK! Call me TK!

193
00:12:56,300 --> 00:12:58,124
And I'm not as small as I look.

194
00:12:58,500 --> 00:13:00,206
There now, is that everybody?

195
00:13:00,360 --> 00:13:03,057
Hey, what happened to that
girl with the funny pink hat?

196
