Well, perhaps she's off picking
flowers or going on a nature hike.

199
00:13:11,800 --> 00:13:14,260
Mommy, help me! Come on!

200
00:13:14,980 --> 00:13:17,039
Okay, so she's not picking flowers.

201
00:13:18,700 --> 00:13:20,360
Mimi, where are you?

202
00:13:21,300 --> 00:13:22,280
There she is!

203
00:13:22,520 --> 00:13:23,620
Mimi, it's okay!

204
00:13:27,260 --> 00:13:28,940
It's that big bug again!

205
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:38,740
Mimi, are you all right?
I think so. Don't worry.

206
00:13:39,120 --> 00:13:41,002
Tannemont's here to protect you.

207
00:13:41,460 --> 00:13:43,420
It's okay now. Oh, sorry.

208
00:13:44,940 --> 00:13:47,280
Watch it. Here he comes. Run!

209
00:13:59,840 --> 00:14:02,140
Will this nightmare never end?

210
00:14:03,700 --> 00:14:07,100
My mom is going to want a
complete and total refund.

211
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:10,240
Here he comes again.

212
00:14:13,040 --> 00:14:14,677
Okay, that does it.

213
00:14:14,760 --> 00:14:15,777
No more running away.

214
00:14:15,860 --> 00:14:18,040
What else can we do? She's right.

215
00:14:18,300 --> 00:14:20,594
There's no way we can fight that thing.

216
00:14:21,060 --> 00:14:22,380
Not in Wynn, anyway.

217
00:14:38,220 --> 00:14:39,050
Great.

218
00:14:39,240 --> 00:14:40,828
Anybody bring a helicopter?

219
00:14:42,900 --> 00:14:44,480
Be careful, Tai. Tai?

220
00:14:47,360 --> 00:14:48,437
There's no way down.

221
00:14:48,520 --> 00:14:50,873
We're going to have to find another way.

222
00:14:51,140 --> 00:14:52,440
Another way where?

223
00:15:01,860 --> 00:15:03,400
Watch out, Tai!

224
00:15:05,440 --> 00:15:06,400
Here I go!

225
00:15:15,620 --> 00:15:17,500
Oh, not again.

226
00:15:19,520 --> 00:15:20,560
Digimon attack!

227
00:15:25,960 --> 00:15:27,120
Yokomon!

228
00:15:36,720 --> 00:15:37,880
Yokomon!

229
00:15:41,260 --> 00:15:44,020
Koromon, are you crazy?

230
00:15:44,360 --> 00:15:45,640
Why'd you do it?

231
00:15:46,440 --> 00:15:48,117
Sorry, it's just...

232
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:50,376
I'm trying to make a good impression.

233
00:15:51,340 --> 00:15:52,440
Crazy guy.

234
00:15:54,820 --> 00:15:55,650
Oh.

235
00:15:56,620 --> 00:15:57,450
Yokomon.

236
00:15:58,320 --> 00:15:59,980
Tanemon, talk to me.

237
00:16:00,780 --> 00:16:03,060
They must be programmed for courage.

238
00:16:03,500 --> 00:16:04,794
Tokomon, what's wrong?

239
00:16:05,120 --> 00:16:06,520
Hey, Tsunomon, wake up.

240
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:09,320
Mukomon, wake up.

241
00:16:10,080 --> 00:16:11,640
What? Oh, no!

242
00:16:18,680 --> 00:16:19,510
Get back!

243
00:16:22,580 --> 00:16:25,000
I was hoping we'd seen the last of him.

244
00:16:25,660 --> 00:16:26,490
Me too.

245
00:16:26,820 --> 00:16:28,585
Guess he had other plans, huh?

246
00:16:30,900 --> 00:16:33,429
I knew I should have
brought my bug spread.

247
00:16:38,640 --> 00:16:40,400
Okay, get ready to run.

248
00:16:44,360 --> 00:16:45,960
No, we fight. Huh?

249
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:47,750
That's right.

250
00:16:48,200 --> 00:16:50,420
It's the only way. Stand and fight.

251
00:16:51,160 --> 00:16:52,395
Give it up, will you?

252
00:16:53,120 --> 00:16:54,117
Oh, Coromon's right.

253
00:16:54,200 --> 00:16:56,097
It's time that we showed
what we're made of.

254
00:16:56,180 --> 00:16:59,920
No, don't. They're right.
No way. It's hopeless.

255
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:02,240
You're no match for him, Yokomon.

256
00:17:02,880 --> 00:17:03,710
You can do it.

257
00:17:05,360 --> 00:17:06,737
Yes, we can do it, we can do it.

258
00:17:09,360 --> 00:17:10,400
Tanemon, you too?

259
00:17:11,120 --> 00:17:11,950
Uh-huh.

260
00:17:12,140 --> 00:17:12,997
I'm sorry, Tai.

261
00:17:13,080 --> 00:17:14,660
Let's go!

262
00:17:19,660 --> 00:17:21,960
Come on, Digimon!

263
00:17:23,420 --> 00:17:25,480
It's useless! Yokomon!

264
00:17:26,580 --> 00:17:27,410
Don't go!

265
00:17:28,240 --> 00:17:29,120
Hold him on!

266
00:17:29,900 --> 00:17:30,900
No, wait!

267
00:17:31,320 --> 00:17:32,555
Don't do it, Digimon!

268
00:17:33,200 --> 00:17:34,030
Don't go!

269
00:17:36,240 --> 00:17:37,780
Turn around!

270
00:17:38,380 --> 00:17:39,700
